      'Coatings earn their keep in exactly these conditions. Ours run about three years with hand-wash maintenance, and the price covers full prep, decontamination and correction, not just the coating itself, because how much correction your paint needs is the real variable. We do need a garage or covered space for the day so it cures properly, which is straightforward at most Marina Bay and Richmond Annex properties.',
